<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg%20xmlns='http%3A//www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%2040%2040'><path%20d='M4%2021%20A16%2015%200%200%201%2036%2021%20Z'%20fill='%2310233F'/><rect%20x='9'%20y='21'%20width='4.4'%20height='6'%20rx='1.6'%20fill='%231D5BD8'/><rect%20x='17.8'%20y='21'%20width='4.4'%20height='10'%20rx='1.6'%20fill='%231D5BD8'/><rect%20x='26.6'%20y='21'%20width='4.4'%20height='14'%20rx='1.6'%20fill='%231D5BD8'/></svg>">
<title>월간 리포트 — Team DIN 보장분석기 리포트</title>
<style>
  :root{--ink:#10233F;--paper:#F6F7F9;--card:#FFFFFF;--line:#E3E7EE;--sub:#5B6B82;--ok:#1D5BD8;--warn:#C77700;--gap:#C93030;--ok-bg:#EDF3FE;--warn-bg:#FDF3E3;--gap-bg:#FBEDED}
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  body{font-family:-apple-system,"Pretendard",sans-serif;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);margin:0;padding:28px 20px 80px;line-height:1.6;font-size:14px}
  .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto}
  .navbar{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:8px 14px;margin-bottom:14px;font-size:13px;color:var(--sub)}
  .navbar .brand-group{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}
  .navbar .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;text-decoration:none;flex:none}
  .navbar .brand .wordmark{font-family:"Noto Serif KR",serif;font-weight:700;font-size:15.5px;color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:-.01em}
  .navbar .menu{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:6px 16px}
  .navbar a,.navbar .who{white-space:nowrap}
  .navbar a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;color:var(--sub);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
  .navbar a:hover{color:var(--ink)}
  .top{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-bottom:24px}
  h1{font-size:24px;margin:0}
  h2{font-family:"Noto Serif KR",serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 12px}
  .sub-note{color:var(--sub);font-size:13px;margin-top:4px}
  .month-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:20px 22px;margin-bottom:20px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(16,35,63,.05),0 1px 3px rgba(16,35,63,.06)}
  .kpis{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-bottom:16px}
  .kpi{background:#F9FAFB;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px}
  .kpi .label{font-size:12px;color:var(--sub);margin-bottom:4px}
  .kpi .value{font-size:19px;font-weight:700}
  table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13.5px}
  thead th{background:#F0F3F8;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--sub);text-align:left;padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  tbody td{padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:middle}
  tbody tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
  td.r{text-align:right}
  .muted{color:var(--sub);font-size:12.5px}
  .empty{padding:14px 0;color:var(--sub);font-size:13px}
  .note{background:#FDF3E3;border:1px solid #F0DDB0;color:#8A5A00;border-radius:8px;padding:12px 16px;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:20px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="navbar">
    <div class="brand-group">
      <a class="brand" href="/">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" width="22" height="22" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 21 A16 15 0 0 1 36 21 Z" fill="#10233F"/><rect x="9" y="21" width="4.4" height="6" rx="1.6" fill="#1D5BD8"/><rect x="17.8" y="21" width="4.4" height="10" rx="1.6" fill="#1D5BD8"/><rect x="26.6" y="21" width="4.4" height="14" rx="1.6" fill="#1D5BD8"/></svg>
        <span class="wordmark">Team DIN 보장분석기</span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="menu">
      <span class="who">{{ user.name }}님 · 관리자</span>
      <a href="/admin">← 관리자 화면</a>
      <a href="/reports">저장된 리포트</a>
      <a href="/logout">로그아웃</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="top">
    <div>
      <h1>월간 리포트</h1>
      <div class="sub-note">{{ start_month }}부터의 활성 유저 · 유저별 생성 리포트 · 접속 빈도 · 고객 열람 수입니다.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="note">
    ※ "접속 빈도"·"활성 유저"는 이 기능을 배포한 시점부터 새로 쌓이는 데이터라, 그 이전 달은 0으로 보일 수 있습니다.
    반면 "생성 리포트"와 "고객 열람 수(공유 링크로 열람된 횟수)"는 처음부터 전체 기간이 집계됩니다.
  </div>

  {% if months %}
    {% for m in months %}
    <div class="month-card">
      <h2>{{ m.month }}</h2>
      <div class="kpis">
        <div class="kpi"><div class="label">활성 유저 수 (접속 기준)</div><div class="value">{{ m.active_users_count }}명</div></div>
        <div class="kpi"><div class="label">총 생성 리포트</div><div class="value">{{ m.reports_total }}건</div></div>
        <div class="kpi"><div class="label">총 접속(요청) 수</div><div class="value">{{ m.activity_total }}회</div></div>
        <div class="kpi"><div class="label">고객 열람 수 (공유 링크)</div><div class="value">{{ m.views_total }}회</div></div>
      </div>

      {% if m.reports_by_user %}
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr><th>유저별 생성 리포트</th><th class="r">건수</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for name, count in m.reports_by_user %}
          <tr><td>{{ name }}</td><td class="r">{{ count }}건</td></tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
      {% else %}
      <div class="empty">이 달에 생성된 리포트가 없습니다.</div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if m.active_users %}
      <div class="muted" style="margin-top:10px">접속한 유저: {{ m.active_users|join(', ') }}</div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  {% else %}
  <div class="empty">해당 기간에 데이터가 없습니다.</div>
  {% endif %}
</div>
</body>
</html>
